  <div class="container">
    <header class="card">
      <h1>Amazon Bestselling Books: Price vs. User Rating Trend Analysis (2009–2019)</h1>
      <p class="lead">A management-focused assessment of pricing, customer satisfaction, and genre dynamics across 550 annual bestseller entries.</p>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:8px; font-size:13px;">Data source: <code>/app/benchmark/data.csv</code> · Period: 2009–2019 · Method: Descriptive statistics + Pearson correlation</p>
